{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Recheck scope fatals after end-hook dispatch.** If a handler scope reports `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` while a blocking `onInvocationEnd` hook runs, the pre-dispatch check has already passed and `execute()` can return PENDING/SUCCEEDED despite observing the fatal before the response. Recheck `scopeFatal` after this block without dispatching hooks again, and update the late-dispatch regression to require the caller to receive the original fatal.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc768xXQ","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":397,"observation_digest":"4ec7af599facb0da99050d8841e439c122195d22813e55a737989621f3b343d2","observation_id":"aro_v1_j3d26wm7vsynvgifbweedzbzye","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-07T18:00:34Z","review_id":"arr_v1_mbnki72rm4xlcac5ngmmkcj7q6","reviewed_base_sha":"a521da02a2586439f6d200f7b1b0b98368d737df","reviewed_head_sha":"01fbdd757073f24e66889aa96a086c51fa8f0bd4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":397,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_2vqgkjj5fyhljfy3upmdoafjif"},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_iwidhks5nfmhcedtcy4ju5y7ww","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T18:00:34Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
